---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<BaseLayout title={`Bio | ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="About Me" width={900} pad="4em 2em">
	<h1 class="bio-name">.butteredtoast</h1>

	<div class="bio-layout">
		<div class="prose">
			<!--
			  RANKING CLAIM. Confirmed accurate as of 2026-09-04. CTFtime standings
			  move, so re-check https://ctftime.org/team/53812 before relying on this
			  in an application, and update the year if 2026 is no longer current.
			-->
			<p>
				Hello! I'm a high school student and CTF player based in Northern Virginia,
				and an officer of <a href="https://ctftime.org/team/53812" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">tjcsc</a> since June 2026.
				The team is currently <strong>#5 globally on CTFtime for 2026</strong> and the
				top ranked US team. That ranking is across all divisions, not a student-only bracket.
			</p>

			<p>
				Day to day that means writing challenges, giving weekly lectures to club
				members on web exploitation, and helping organize TJCTF and WinterCTF.
				Most of all it means competing. The officer team is the group that plays
				events under tjcsc, and that is where the ranking comes from.
			</p>

			<p>My main category is web, and I'm branching out into pwn and rev as secondary categories.</p>

			<p>
				Outside of CTFs, I do web dev and some competitive programming on the side,
				plus challenge building when I get a good idea. I also co-founded
				<strong>H.O.N.K.</strong>, a game studio, with three friends after we won 8bit jam.
			</p>

			<p>I like buttered toast.</p>
		</div>

		<aside class="info-card">
			<div class="info-row">
				<span class="info-label">Location</span>
				<span>Northern Virginia</span>
			</div>
			<div class="info-row">
				<span class="info-label">Team</span>
				<span><a href="https://ctftime.org/team/53812" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">tjcsc</a></span>
				<span class="info-note">Officer since June 2026 &middot; #5 globally, 2026</span>
			</div>
			<div class="info-row">
				<span class="info-label">Focus</span>
				<div class="specialties">
					<span class="badge primary category-web">web</span>
					<span class="badge category-pwn">pwn</span>
					<span class="badge category-reversing">rev</span>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="info-links">
				<a href="https://ctftime.org/user/247161" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CTFtime</a>
				<a href="https://github.com/butteredsaltedtoast" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
			</div>
		</aside>
	</div>

	<style>
		.bio-name {
			background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--text) 0%, var(--accent) 60%, var(--accent-secondary) 100%);
			-webkit-background-clip: text;
			background-clip: text;
			color: transparent;
			width: fit-content;
			margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
		}

		.bio-layout {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: 1fr 240px;
			gap: var(--space-8);
			align-items: start;
		}

		.prose p { margin-bottom: var(--space-6); }

		.prose strong { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; }

		.info-card {
			background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--surface-2) 0%, var(--surface) 100%);
			border: 1px solid var(--border);
			border-radius: var(--radius);
			padding: var(--space-6);
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: var(--space-4);
			font-size: 0.9rem;
			position: sticky;
			top: var(--space-8);
		}

		.info-row { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-1); }

		.info-label {
			font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
			font-size: 0.65rem;
			text-transform: uppercase;
			letter-spacing: 0.1em;
			color: var(--text-muted);
		}

		.info-note {
			font-size: 0.75rem;
			color: var(--accent-secondary);
			line-height: 1.4;
		}

		.specialties { display: flex; gap: var(--space-2); flex-wrap: wrap; }

		.badge {
			font-size: 0.75rem;
			padding: 0.15em 0.7em;
			border: 1px solid currentColor;
			border-radius: 999px;
			opacity: 0.5;
			white-space: nowrap;
		}
		.badge.primary { opacity: 1; font-weight: 700; }

		.info-links {
			display: flex;
			gap: var(--space-4);
			padding-top: var(--space-4);
			border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
		}

		@media (max-width: 720px) {
			.bio-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
			.info-card { position: static; }
		}
	</style>
</BaseLayout>
